@startuml
title A checkout through the containers
actor Customer as C
participant "Storefront\n(browser)" as SPA
participant "Load\nbalancer" as LB
participant "Web\ngateway" as GW
participant "Order\nservice" as O
participant "Cart\nservice" as K
participant "Catalog\nservice" as CAT
database "Order\ndatabase" as DB
queue "Pub/Sub" as PS

C -> SPA : submits the checkout
SPA -> LB : POST /api/v1/orders\nsession cookie, anti-forgery token
LB -> GW : forwards
note over GW : finds the session,\nadds the access token
GW -> O : POST /v1/orders, access token
note over O : validates the token,\nchecks the role
O -> K : GET /v1/cart, same token
K --> O : the lines of this customer
O -> CAT : GET /v1/products?sku=…
CAT --> O : current prices, status, availability
note over O : nothing changed since\nthe review: the order is created
O -> DB : one transaction: order PENDING,\nsaga, ReserveStock in the outbox
O --> GW : 201 Created, order PENDING
GW --> SPA : 201 Created
SPA --> C : "your order is being processed"
O ->> PS : the relay publishes ReserveStock
note over PS : the saga continues\nas messages (document 03-03)
loop until the order is no longer pending
  SPA -> GW : GET /api/v1/orders/{number}
  GW -> O : GET /v1/orders/{number}
  O --> SPA : status
end
@enduml
